{"5083880":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The Community Notes Are Wrong","steam_appid":5083880,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5083880\/extras\/5aa7602b6fac526d31b3e41c6e0d0458.avif?t=1789240937\" width=825 height=180 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ayla Solace rose to fame through raw, emotional songs about the woman she loved. Her fans see her as the perfect &quot;lesbian icon.&quot; Her agency sees her as a brand that should stay easy to sell<i>.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the lesbian label never accurately described her, Ayla leaned into it to avoid disappointing her community… and to appease her ex-girlfriend, who didn't like the word <i>bisexual<\/i>. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ayla's world shatters when a quiet date with a male barista is caught on camera and goes viral. Her bisexual identity suddenly public, Ayla must now navigate the intense biphobia and scrutiny of a social media firestorm.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5083880\/extras\/e50471da64d2343f5caef27c3b2420a7.avif?t=1789240937\" width=825 height=180 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5083880\/extras\/c93d4c18e6a10e7322fae741ccd80204.avif?t=1789240937\" width=1493 height=1300 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5083880\/extras\/30beddaca982bda808bde5180bd05b50.avif?t=1789240937\" width=1493 height=1300 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_i